      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776859901331,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "假设一个红圈儿就是构成字符串 s 的重复子字符串",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "假设一个红圈儿就是构成字符串 s 的重复子字符串",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "YBurP6beEei2Y5KBm6qlZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 152.15481412633562,
      "y": 473.9646126641228,
      "width": 658.739990234375,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aD",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 878679437,
      "version": 526,
      "versionNonce": 1785832690,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776859901051,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "如果字符串 s 有重复子字符串，那么重复子字符串的数量一定 >= 2\n\n如果子字符串数量 n = 2\n破坏掉拼接后的新字符串的首尾之后，还有 2 个有效，此时包含原始串\n\n如果子字符串数量 n > 2\n破坏掉拼接后的新字符串的首尾之后，还有 2n - 2 个有效，也包含原始串",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "如果字符串 s 有重复子字符串，那么重复子字符串的数量一定 >= 2\n\n如果子字符串数量 n = 2\n破坏掉拼接后的新字符串的首尾之后，还有 2 个有效，此时包含原始串\n\n如果子字符串数量 n > 2\n破坏掉拼接后的新字符串的首尾之后，还有 2n - 2 个有效，也包含原始串",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "po65iuW4xHVTOCAyv_5Jx",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 169.98114244995213,
      "y": -128.0583626641228,
      "width": 588,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
